                <note rend="inline" type="source">819.74/261: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gonzalez</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-11-21T19:00:00-05:00">November 21, 1933—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>105. Your telegram No. 160, November 13, 4 p.m. After consultation with Navy
                    Department no objection perceived to your making informal inquiries.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
